      "markdown": "**Customer FILE** — Declares a data file: its driver, its keys and memos, and its RECORD\n\n**Attributes:** `DRIVER` [PRE](command:clarion.applyAttributeEdit?%5B%7B%22e%22%3A%5B%7B%22l%22%3A0%2C%22c%22%3A44%2C%22el%22%3A0%2C%22ec%22%3A53%2C%22t%22%3A%22%22%2C%22o%22%3A%5B%22Customer%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20FILE%2CDRIVER%28'TOPSPEED'%29%2CPRE%28CUS%29%2CCREATE%22%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D \"Remove PRE(CUS)\") [CREATE](command:clarion.applyAttributeEdit?%5B%7B%22e%22%3A%5B%7B%22l%22%3A0%2C%22c%22%3A53%2C%22el%22%3A0%2C%22ec%22%3A60%2C%22t%22%3A%22%22%2C%22o%22%3A%5B%22Customer%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20FILE%2CDRIVER%28'TOPSPEED'%29%2CPRE%28CUS%29%2CCREATE%22%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D \"Remove CREATE\")\n\n**Available:** [BINDABLE](command:clarion.applyAttributeEdit?%5B%7B%22e%22%3A%5B%7B%22l%22%3A0%2C%22c%22%3A60%2C%22el%22%3A0%2C%22ec%22%3A60%2C%22t%22%3A%22%2CBINDABLE%22%2C%22o%22%3A%5B%22Customer%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20FILE%2CDRIVER%28'TOPSPEED'%29%2CPRE%28CUS%29%2CCREATE%22%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D \"Add BINDABLE\") [DLL](command:clarion.applyAttributeEdit?%5B%7B%22e%22%3A%5B%7B%22l%22%3A0%2C%22c%22%3A60%2C%22el%22%3A0%2C%22ec%22%3A60%2C%22t%22%3A%22%2CEXTERNAL%2CDLL%22%2C%22o%22%3A%5B%22Customer%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20FILE%2CDRIVER%28'TOPSPEED'%29%2CPRE%28CUS%29%2CCREATE%22%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D \"Add DLL, with EXTERNAL, which it requires\") [ENCRYPT](command:clarion.applyAttributeEdit?%5B%7B%22e%22%3A%5B%7B%22l%22%3A0%2C%22c%22%3A60%2C%22el%22%3A0%2C%22ec%22%3A60%2C%22t%22%3A%22%2COWNER%28'%24%7B1%3Apassword%7D'%29%2CENCRYPT%22%2C%22o%22%3A%5B%22Customer%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20FILE%2CDRIVER%28'TOPSPEED'%29%2CPRE%28CUS%29%2CCREATE%22%5D%2C%22s%22%3Atrue%7D%5D%7D%5D \"Add ENCRYPT, with OWNER('password'), which it requires\") [EXTERNAL](command:clarion.applyAttributeEdit?%5B%7B%22e%22%3A%5B%7B%22l%22%3A0%2C%22c%22%3A60%2C%22el%22%3A0%2C%22ec%22%3A60%2C%22t%22%3A%22%2CEXTERNAL%22%2C%22o%22%3A%5B%22Customer%20%20%20%